				<r3d:description language="eng">The University of Lodz Repository is an institutional repository whose purpose is to disseminate the scholarly output of its staff and promote research conducted at the UL. It is an archive of its own electronic documents – each deposited publication or collection of research data is given a permanent identifier (handle), enabling the document to be cited and indexed in scientific databases.
The University of Lodz Repository operates as an institutional repository based on Regulation No. 51 of the Rector of the University of Lodz of 31 March 2015.</r3d:description>
